sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as Engineer (New Laptop)
    participant GH as GitHub<br/>(karthikreddyyalala/MCP_Base)
    participant pip as pip / pyproject.toml
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>(internet, first run only)
    participant ST as SentenceTransformer<br/>(all-MiniLM-L6-v2, ~80MB)
    participant idx as index.py
    participant CDB as ChromaDB (~/.mcp-kb/)
    participant cfg as Claude Desktop Config<br/>(claude_desktop_config.json)
    participant CD as Claude Desktop

    Note over Dev,CD: STEP 1 — Install (one time)
    Dev->>GH: git clone https://github.com/karthikreddyyalala/MCP_Base.git
    Dev->>pip: pip install -e .
    pip-->>Dev: installs mcp, chromadb, sentence-transformers, typer

    Note over Dev,ST: STEP 2 — First embed (downloads model once)
    Dev->>idx: python3 index.py --docs ./your-docs
    idx->>HF: Download all-MiniLM-L6-v2 weights (~80MB)
    HF-->>ST: Model cached to ~/.cache/huggingface/
    Note over ST: All future runs are fully offline

    idx->>ST: encode(each 400-token chunk)
    ST-->>idx: float32[384] embedding per chunk
    idx->>CDB: Persist embeddings + metadata to disk
    CDB-->>Dev: Index ready. e.g. "847 chunks from 12 files"

    Note over Dev,CD: STEP 3 — Wire to Claude Desktop
    Dev->>cfg: Add MCP server entry with absolute paths<br/>command: python3, args: [/abs/path/src/server.py]
    Dev->>CD: Restart Claude Desktop

    Note over CD,CDB: STEP 4 — Claude discovers tools
    CD->>idx: MCP initialize handshake (stdio)
    idx-->>CD: tools: [search_docs, list_docs]
    CD-->>Dev: Hammer icon appears in chat input ✓

    Note over Dev,CDB: STEP 5 — Normal usage (fully offline after here)
    Dev->>CD: "How do I rotate the API key?"
    CD->>idx: tools/call search_docs("rotate API key")
    idx->>CDB: ANN search (local disk)
    CDB-->>idx: Top 5 chunks with line citations
    idx-->>CD: Results injected into context
    CD-->>Dev: Answer + [source: api-reference.md:L42-L51]
